{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 51,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        124.79139709472656,
        27.289522171020508,
        328.7294006347656,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "6. EVIDENCE FOR RECOMMENDATIONS FOR TREATMENT OF PNEUMONIA",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        59.74208068847656,
        396.86297607421875,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "to each group. At baseline, 73–80% of children had a history of fever, and 30–",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.1128234863281,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "50% recorded a temperature >37.8 °C. While 50–60% of children had wheeze on",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        268.1929626464844,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "examination, only 5–6% reported history of wheeze.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0912780761719,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "Using intention-to-treat (ITT) analysis, by day 3, 50 children in the amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        399.122802734375,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "group (11.1%) and 45 children in the placebo group (10%) failed treatment. The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        124.74208068847656,
        399.0125427246094,
        138.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "difference was not statistically significant: odds ratio (95% CI) 1.13 (0.72 to 1.76).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        137.74208068847656,
        399.142822265625,
        151.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "Cumulative treatment failure by day 5 was also similar between the two groups (OR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        150.74208068847656,
        399.0828857421875,
        164.23208618164062
      ],
      "text": "0.87, 95% CI 0.61 to 1.24). Per-protocol, 7.2% (31/431) of children in the amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        163.7421112060547,
        399.1028747558594,
        177.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "group and 8.3% (37/442) in the placebo group failed treatment on day 3 (OR 0.85,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        176.7421112060547,
        399.0927429199219,
        190.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "95% CI 0.50 to 1.43). There was no difference in relapse by day 14 (OR 0.58, 95% 0.11",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        189.7421112060547,
        90.78289794921875,
        203.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "to 2.81).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        202.7421112060547,
        399.081298828125,
        216.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "There were no differences between groups in the number of children requiring",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        215.7421112060547,
        399.0528564453125,
        229.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "change (or initiation) of antibiotics, the number of children who developed danger",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        228.7421112060547,
        385.0428161621094,
        242.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "signs, or the number of children requiring hospitalization. There were no deaths.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        241.7421112060547,
        399.0315246582031,
        255.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "On logistic regression analysis, treatment failure was associated with a history of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        254.7421112060547,
        399.062744140625,
        268.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "difficulty breathing (OR 2.86, 95% CI 1.13 to 7.23), and temperature > 37.8 °C (OR",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        267.7420959472656,
        216.8529815673828,
        281.23211669921875
      ],
      "text": "1.99, 95% CI 1.37 to 2.90) at enrolment.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        289.2361145019531,
        381.1829528808594,
        301.3760986328125
      ],
      "text": "Antibiotics in children presenting with non-severe pneumonia and wheeze in India",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Obli",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        302.24609375,
        399.1128234863281,
        315.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Awasthi et al (2008) was a double-blinded, randomized controlled multi-centre",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        315.24609375,
        399.0528869628906,
        328.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "trial in India using amoxicillin (31–54 mg/kg/day) versus placebo for children 2–59",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        328.24609375,
        399.1029357910156,
        341.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "months with WHO non-severe pneumonia and wheeze (audible or auscultatory). The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        341.24609375,
        399.0528564453125,
        354.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "study was powered to detect non-inferiority of placebo. Children were enrolled if",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        354.24609375,
        399.0429382324219,
        367.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "they presented with WHO-defined non-severe pneumonia, did not respond to up to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        367.24609375,
        399.1327209472656,
        380.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "three doses of inhaled salbutamol, and had a normal chest X-ray. Recruited children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        380.24609375,
        399.1028137207031,
        393.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "were treated as outpatients with oral salbutamol and either amoxicillin or placebo.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        393.24609375,
        399.032958984375,
        406.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "Outcomes were treatment failure at day 4, defined as development of WHO-defined",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        406.24609375,
        396.7928771972656,
        419.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "severe or very severe pneumonia, hypoxaemia (SpO2<90%), or persistence of non-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        419.24609375,
        399.0428771972656,
        432.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "severe pneumonia, wheeze or fever. Clinical relapse was defined as cases which were",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.24609375,
        399.05279541015625,
        445.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "clinically cured by day 4, but showed signs of WHO-defined pneumonia by day 11–14.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        445.24609375,
        399.0813293457031,
        458.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "The study recruited 1671: 836 in the placebo group and 835 in the amoxicillin",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.24609375,
        399.1729431152344,
        471.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "group. Loss to follow-up was <5% by day 14. Baseline characteristics of both groups",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        471.24609375,
        399.0428466796875,
        484.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "were similar: adherence to placebo and amoxicillin was higher than 95%, and there",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        484.24609375,
        399.10284423828125,
        497.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "were no differences between groups in adherence to oral salbutamol. Respiratory",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        497.24609375,
        399.0226745605469,
        510.7361145019531
      ],
      "text": "syncytial virus (RSV) was detected in nasopharyngeal aspirates of 48 of 778 children",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        510.24609375,
        399.0727844238281,
        523.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "in the placebo group (6.2%) and 40 of 780 children in the amoxicillin group (5.1%).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        523.24609375,
        399.0029602050781,
        536.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "About 15% of children had audible wheeze; for the rest, wheeze was only heard on",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        536.24609375,
        111.18289184570312,
        549.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "auscultation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        549.24609375,
        399.1313781738281,
        562.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "On ITT analysis, placebo was inferior to amoxicillin: 24% of children in the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        562.24609375,
        399.1428527832031,
        575.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "placebo and 19.9% in the amoxicillin groups failed treatment (difference 4.2%, 95%",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        575.24609375,
        399.1228942871094,
        588.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "CI 0.2 to 8.2). There was no difference in the rates of relapse. Clinical failure due",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        588.24609375,
        399.06298828125,
        601.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "to the development of severe or very severe pneumonia or hypoxaemia was similar",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        601.24609375,
        125.04290008544922,
        614.736083984375
      ],
      "text": "between groups.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        223.50599670410156,
        644.9403076171875,
        231.53399658203125,
        655.2992553710938
      ],
      "text": "37",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ]
}